Demo model
  The pictures and examples use GO_New_Stores, the sample database that ships
  with an IBM TM1 installation. Its names appear only to show the plugins at
  work; the sample itself is not distributed here.

Bedrock
  TM1 12 Readiness compares a model's Bedrock processes with Bedrock 5, which it
  reads from its own repository, github.com/cubewise-code/bedrock-5, under
  Bedrock's licence. Bedrock's code is not included in this repository.

